OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start with some
OL,6,Fbrightness or hazy sunshine. Cloud
OL,7,Fwill steadily thicken through the day,
OL,8,Fbringing a few outbreaks of light,
OL,9,Fpatchy rain later on.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA largely cloudy but dry
OL,12,Fevening. The rest of the night will
OL,13,Fremain dry for many, though some
OL,14,Fpatchy light rain is possible at times.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FCloudy with showery outbreaks
OL,17,Fof rain spreading northwards, some of
OL,18,Fwhich will likely be heavy later in
OL,19,Fthe day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
