OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FChangeable with a risk of showers,
OL,7,Fsome heavy on Tuesday. Showers will
OL,8,Fbecome more scattered through
OL,9,FWednesday and Thursday.
